WHAT WILL THE STUDENT LEARN?
Business and Academic Communication in a Foreign Language will help students improve various skills and be able to:
• demonstrate the ability to summarize, paraphrase and make synthesis in the written and oral speech process;
• select reasonable writing strategy; make business communication in a written form;
• communicate ideas and information in a variety of ways using appropriate communication techniques for the business environment;
• expand and actively use academic and business vocabulary related to a wide range of topics and work related situations;
• fluently and accurately express personal point of view and explain it; make business communication in an oral form;
• take part in group or class discussions;
• speak on business, intellectual and social matters;
• make written presentations;
